        {
          "episode": 4,
          "name": "Replacements",
          "overview": "With the addition of many new men, Easy Company heads to Holland to participate in Operation Market Garden and prepare an Allied route into Germany, but they meet stiff German resistance.",
          "plot": "The band decides to take a break and spend the day at the beach. David and Thomas are jealous that Nat attracts all the girls when they become attracted to two girls out on a boat, so they pretend to drown and be attacked by sharks to get their attention. On the other hand, Mr. Wolff and Qaasim pass out flyers for the band's next concert. Meanwhile, Alex and Jesse try to break a world record for sand counting. Nat recalls when Rosalina kissed him on the cheek during a concert in Chicago; however, she says she does not remember.Song Performed: \"Fishing For Love\"Music Produced by: Michael A. Levine, Michael WolffMusic Supervised by: Michael WolffMusic Written and Performed by: Nat Wolff",
