        {
          "episode": 5,
          "name": "Crossroads",
          "overview": "Winters writes a report on the challenge of an unexpected resistance to a German attack, and is haunted by his conscience after shooting a teenage German soldier. Operation Pegasus is depicted. Easy Company is called to Bastogne to repel the sudden German counterattack.",
          "plot": "Alex gets a new clothing line and is satisfied until he sees everyone wearing it, including a boy who pretends to be him. On the other hand, Nat writes a song about a blond haired girl with shiny blue eyes. A suspicious Rosalina questions whether or not him has a girlfriend. It is later revealed that Nat only wrote those lyrics so the rest of the band would no longer ridicule the fact that he has a crush on Rosalina.Song Performed: \"Beautiful Eyes\"Music Produced by: Michael A. Levine, Michael WolffMusic Supervised by: Michael WolffMusic Written and Performed by: Nat Wolff",
